y":"明"}},{"title":"义舟","author":"徐庸","text":"巨舟平压水中天，一挂风帆稳济川。\n沧海自深入自渡，不教来往费青钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"义桥","author":"徐庸","text":"神鞭驱石用功多，螮蝀垂形跨海波。\n老我笑非题柱客，高车驷马看人过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"义槥","author":"徐庸","text":"慱济存心久不违，松函顾与载全归。\n麦舟事往无人继，此日多君得庶几。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画 其一","author":"徐庸","text":"伐木丁丁响翠微，苍松不拟白云飞。\n石桥西去人家近，花落闲庭昼掩扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画 其二","author":"徐庸","text":"看山亭上晚凉多，曲曲朱栏瞰玉河。\n一派响泉云外落，长流不息似恩波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈宗理御史所赠杨仲举竹","author":"徐庸","text":"乌台御史似王猷，种得琅玕几度秋。\n香墨写成鸾凤尾，赠君携取到长洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":33139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画二首 其一","author":"徐庸","text":"五老峰前瀑布流，望湖亭上谪仙游。\n若为更把瑶琴弄，并作乾坤一片秋。"